OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief apologises over care
OL,4,Ainquiry comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's chief of police has apologised
OL,7,Fafter he called an inquiry into decades
OL,8,Fof child abuse a "noose round the
OL,9,Fisland's neck".
OL,11,FThe comments by Robin Smith in January
OL,12,F2025 about the Independent Jersey Care
OL,13,FInquiry became public during an unfair
OL,14,Fdismissal claim brought by former
OL,15,Fsocial worker Alison Renouf.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
