OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief apologises over care
OL,4,Ainquiry comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Smith said his comments
OL,7,Fduring a meeting of senior officials
OL,8,F"may have caused concern, particularly
OL,9,Famong those who experienced abuse and
OL,10,Fthose who have worked tirelessly to
OL,11,Fensure the lessons of the past are
OL,12,Fnever forgotten".
OL,14,FSenior politicians said they still had
OL,15,F"full trust and confidence" in Smith's
OL,16,Fleadership.
